From: Chun <tanimlanamayanoyuncu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:57:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] local: direct P2P match traffic next to the relay

The server offers the peer's game-socket addresses when both players allow it;
packets keep the relay header and go straight to the peer, the relay is used
until a direct packet arrives (and again after 1.5 s without one).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LQoazeoBfEffqvK6NngMiX
---
